## What is FOSSBilling?

FOSSBilling is a **free and open-source** billing and client management platform for hosting providers, domain resellers, and digital service businesses.

Use it to manage the day-to-day work of running a hosting or services business:
- Web hosting account provisioning and management
- Domain registration and transfers
- Invoicing and payment processing
- Client management and support tickets
- Staff workflows, automation, and reporting

## Key Features

{% cardgrid stagger=true %}
{% card title="Hosting Management" icon="server" %}
Connect with cPanel, Plesk, HestiaCP, DirectAdmin, and more.
{% /card %}
{% card title="Domain Registration" icon="globe" %}
Resell domains through Namecheap, Netim, and other registrars.
{% /card %}
{% card title="Payment Processing" icon="credit-card" %}
Accept payments via PayPal, Stripe, and many other gateways.
{% /card %}
{% card title="Extensible" icon="puzzle" %}
Build custom modules, themes, and integrations with our API.
{% /card %}
{% /cardgrid %}

## Get Started

Head to the [Getting Started guide](/getting-started/) to review requirements, choose an installation method, and launch your first instance.

You can also [browse the docs](/getting-started/) to explore setup, customization, development, and maintenance guides.
